{
 "id": "seg5",
 "title": "监控与应急",
 "pill": 5,
 "total": 91.3,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5-00",
   "text": "上线不是终点。",
   "spoken": "上线不是终点。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg5-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 1.76,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 3.146
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-01",
   "text": "合约上线以后，要有人一直盯着。",
   "spoken": "合约上线以后，要有人一直盯着。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg5-01.wav",
   "start": 3.58,
   "dur": 2.64,
   "speechStart": 3.58,
   "speechEnd": 6.024
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-02",
   "text": "同时开一个漏洞赏金，让发现问题的白帽，有动力先来报告。",
   "spoken": "同时开一个漏洞赏金，让发现问题的白帽，有动力先来报告。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg5-02.wav",
   "start": 6.44,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 6.44,
   "speechEnd": 11.495
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-03",
   "text": "盯什么？锁仓总量突然下跌，比如 10 分钟内跌了超过 10%。",
   "spoken": "盯什么？锁仓总量突然下跌，比如 10 分钟内跌了超过 10%。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg5-03.wav",
   "start": 11.94,
   "dur": 6.72,
   "speechStart": 12.033,
   "speechEnd": 18.457
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-04",
   "text": "同一笔交易里，出现大额闪电贷和本协议的调用。",
   "spoken": "同一笔交易里，出现大额闪电贷和本协议的掉用。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg5-04.wav",
   "start": 18.88,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speechStart": 18.977,
   "speechEnd": 23.188
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-05",
   "text": "任何管理员函数被调用，实现地址变了，时间锁队列里多了新操作。",
   "spoken": "任何管理员函数被掉用，实现地址变了，时间锁队列里多了新操作。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg5-05.wav",
   "start": 23.58,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "speechStart": 23.58,
   "speechEnd": 29.351
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-06",
   "text": "预言机价格偏离其他来源，或者超过心跳时间没有更新。",
   "spoken": "预言机价格偏离其他来源，或者超过心跳时间没有更新。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg5-06.wav",
   "start": 29.8,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 29.8,
   "speechEnd": 34.256
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-07",
   "text": "跨链两侧，锁定量和铸造量对不上。",
   "spoken": "跨链两侧，锁定量和铸造量对不上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg5-07.wav",
   "start": 34.66,
   "dur": 3.68,
   "speechStart": 34.66,
   "speechEnd": 38.129
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-08",
   "text": "告警响起，接下来是应急流程。",
   "spoken": "告警响起，接下来是应急流程。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg5-08.wav",
   "start": 38.56,
   "dur": 2.56,
   "speechStart": 38.651,
   "speechEnd": 40.936
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-09",
   "text": "值班人员先确认异常。",
   "spoken": "值班人员先确认异常。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg5-09.wav",
   "start": 41.34,
   "dur": 1.92,
   "speechStart": 41.34,
   "speechEnd": 43.088
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-10",
   "text": "确认后触发暂停，守护者的暂停权限没有延迟。",
   "spoken": "确认后触发暂停，守护者的暂停权限没有延迟。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg5-10.wav",
   "start": 43.48,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 43.48,
   "speechEnd": 47.566
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-11",
   "text": "然后组建作战室，里面有开发和审计方，还有安全响应团队，比如 SEAL 911 这类社区应急组织。",
   "spoken": "然后组建作战室，里面有开发和审计方，还有安全响应团队，比如 SEAL 911 这类社区应急组织。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg5-11.wav",
   "start": 48.02,
   "dur": 8.32,
   "speechStart": 48.118,
   "speechEnd": 56.149
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-12",
   "text": "评估能不能白帽救援，抢先把剩余资金转到安全的地方。",
   "spoken": "评估能不能白帽救援，抢先把剩余资金转到安全的地方。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg5-12.wav",
   "start": 56.56,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 56.56,
   "speechEnd": 61.176
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-13",
   "text": "联系交易所和稳定币发行方，冻结被盗资金。",
   "spoken": "联系交易所和稳定币发形方，冻结被盗资金。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg5-13.wav",
   "start": 61.58,
   "dur": 4.24,
   "speechStart": 61.674,
   "speechEnd": 65.652
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-14",
   "text": "最后发布公告和复盘。",
   "spoken": "最后发布公告和复盘。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg5-14.wav",
   "start": 66.04,
   "dur": 2.16,
   "speechStart": 66.04,
   "speechEnd": 67.988
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-15",
   "text": "看一个例子。",
   "spoken": "看一个例子。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg5-15.wav",
   "start": 68.42,
   "dur": 0.88,
   "speechStart": 68.42,
   "speechEnd": 69.111
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-16",
   "text": "在 Bybit 事故里，mETH 协议追回了 cmETH。",
   "spoken": "在 Bybit 事故里，mETH 协议追回了 cmETH。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg5-16.wav",
   "start": 69.52,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 69.616,
   "speechEnd": 74.392
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-17",
   "text": "靠的是三样东西，协议本身有提款延迟，团队有暂停权限，外部安全社区快速牵线。",
   "spoken": "靠的是三样东西，协议本身有提款延迟，团队有暂停权限，外部安全社区快速牵线。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg5-17.wav",
   "start": 74.78,
   "dur": 8.56,
   "speechStart": 74.884,
   "speechEnd": 83.133
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-18",
   "text": "这三样，没有一样是出事当天才能加上的。",
   "spoken": "这三样，没有一样是出事当天才能加上的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg5-18.wav",
   "start": 83.56,
   "dur": 3.36,
   "speechStart": 83.56,
   "speechEnd": 86.755
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-19",
   "text": "应急能力，要事先设计进合约。",
   "spoken": "应急能力，要事先设计进合约。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg5-19.wav",
